title: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042
intro: Every link that opens a case page, and what the page does with the ID it is given: find the request, load your earlier work, pick the tab.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: R-1042 is the one hand-written case. Every other case page is generated from its queue record or Dashboard request, so the numbers are consistent but the wording is a template. An ID that is an approved authorization with no open request opens the ledger case page. An ID in neither ends at 'Request not found'.
---
group gIn "Links that open a case page"
  start a1 "Authorizations: click a row's request ID"
  start a2 "Authorizations: click a row's 'Go to action', 'Open the draft', 'Open' or 'Open case'"
  start a3 "Dashboard: click 'Open case' in a request drawer"
  start a4 "Authorizations: click 'Open case' in an approved authorization's quick view"
  start a6 "Authorizations › Reviews this week: click 'Open case' in a review drawer"
  start a7 "Eligibility & Benefits result: click 'Open case'"
  start a8 "Notification 'Approval chance updated'"
  start a9 "Type the address /authorizations/case/ID"
  start a10 "Authorizations: open a request's quick view, then click 'Open case'"
endgroup

process r0 "Case page reads the ID from the address"
decision d1 "Is the ID R-1042?"
process hand "Hand-written case\n9 requirements, 6 actions, chance 62% rising to 88%"
decision d2 "Is there a queue record for this ID, or for the Dashboard request it belongs to?"
process fq "Page is built from the queue record\nand from its Dashboard request when there is one"
decision d3 "Is there a Dashboard request with this ID or this case ID?"
process fr "Page is built from the Dashboard request\nDecided ones show their result and have nothing left to send"
process gen "Chance, actions, criteria, draft and checks are generated\nfrom the payer, level of care and chance"

decision d5 "Is the ID in the approved-authorization ledger?"
goto gL "Continues in: Authorizations › Ledger case page › Open and read"
screen nf "'Request not found'\n'No request X' and 'Back to Authorizations'"
click bq "Click 'Back to Authorizations' or the 'Authorizations' crumb"
goto gQ "Continues in: Authorizations › Worklist › Arrive and read the views"

store ld "Your earlier work on this case is loaded\nAnswers, applied and dismissed actions, focus, clinical context, draft edits, log"
decision dS "Is the case at a site the viewer has in view?"
screen oos "Card 'This case is not available at Site A'\nNames the site, not the patient"
goto gO "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › A case at another site"
decision d4 "Does ?tab= name one of the three tabs, or one of the five old names?"
screen tab1 "That tab opens, an old name on its merged tab\ne.g. a review drawer opens '?tab=draft' on 'Clinical picture & draft'"
screen tab0 "'Recommended actions' opens"
goto gH "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Header and buttons"

a1 --> r0
a2 --> r0
a3 --> r0
a4 --> r0
a6 --> r0
a7 --> r0
a8 --> r0
a9 --> r0
a10 --> r0
r0 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| hand --> dS
d1 -->|No| d2
d2 -->|Yes| fq --> gen
d2 -->|No| d3
d3 -->|Yes| fr --> gen
d3 -->|No| d5
d5 -->|Yes| gL
d5 -->|No| nf
nf --> bq --> gQ
gen --> dS
dS -->|Yes| ld
dS -->|No| oos --> gO
ld --> d4
d4 -->|Yes| tab1 --> gH
d4 -->|No or missing| tab0 --> gH
